{
  "bookId": "rewind-52",
  "id": "chapter-216",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "42017001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "潮酷街区。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017002",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "呼——呼——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "真的起风了……现在的天气研究员原来也在继续使用孔明灯进行测定。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "准确度意外地很高。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "东风，是这个方向。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017007",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "只见无数蒲公英籽如同小小的白云从菲伊的头顶飘过，飞向远方。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒲公英籽",
          "text": "随风而去~随风而去~让我们飞向没有尽头的空虚~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒲公英籽",
          "text": "今天结束还有明天，明天结束还有后天……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "……难道是蒲公英成为了传播绝望的媒介……？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "先去风吹来的方向，那边应该就是源头。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017012",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "潮酷街区某处。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "网兜再朝下面一点！那边飞出去了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "不行，就算有帕拉斯的辅助，还是跟不上这群种子飘散的速度。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "可恶……明明好不容易找到这群蒲公英就位于香水浓度最高的区域……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "很有可能这就是源头之一。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "菲伊？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "剩余香水估计已经全部使用了，我现在过去已经起不到作用了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "我听到了蒲公英籽们的声音。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "和你们推测的一样，现在绝望的情绪正在通过这些种子蔓延，必须阻止他们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "考虑到它们的移动速度，直接捕获很困难。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "改变风向。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "你的意思是……让这群种子飞到不会影响手办的高空？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "嗯，我们可以人工制造对流风。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42017025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "原来如此，那么行动吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-1067",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "faye",
          "rowIds": [
            42017001,
            42017002,
            42017003,
            42017004,
            42017005,
            42017006,
