        }
      ],
      "title": "邂逅于落月·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "42019001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "尤兰达",
          "text": "你们的担心我也可以理解。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "尤兰达",
          "text": "或许可以用上人工叫醒服务~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "监测睡梦中的脑电波的波动值，来判断精神状态的理论吗?",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "尤兰达",
          "text": "没错，借由你那边的帕拉斯，是有实现的可能性的。虽然手办没有物理意义上的大脑，不过生物电子信号是存在的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "原来如此……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "这是我一个人的行动，不必担心，不会对大家的生命产生影响。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "是在担心你的生命安全哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "我不明白。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "明明你们可以选择去做自己的事情才更有效率……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "才不是这样！一起吃好吃的烤肉，一起和小蘑菇玩，我们已经是朋友了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "与其说和蘑菇玩，那个是处理蘑菇疯长的必要措施……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "总之就是这样，对朋友的关心可不是什么没效率的事情哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "而且帮助菲伊找到贝歌，可以更快让街区重回平常的样子，这也是我们的职责。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "我明白了……多谢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "嘿嘿。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "结合尤兰达的说明，菲伊做好了入梦的准备。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "尤兰达",
          "text": "这样就没问题了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "脑波临时监测装置已经完成，随时可以连接。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "尤兰达",
          "text": "接下来，就是等菲伊入睡了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "15分钟后。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "很清醒，依然可以说出100种不同种类的花朵种类。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "完全没有入睡迹象呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "一想到还有事情没做完，就完全没有睡意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "看样子只能去请睡眠大师出山了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "是我，是我！每次我只要想到烤肉就很快睡着啦！今天的烤肉~明天的烤肉~后天的烤肉~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "过了一会儿，睡眠大师睡眼惺忪地到达了现场。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "明明星洛睡觉也很厉害！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "呼啊————终于到了吗，真是的，还没睡醒呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "拜托你了，睡眠大师。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "总之，先躺在舒服的夕阳下……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "躺下了，阳光很刺眼。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "闭上已经很重很重的眼皮……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "听起来教学细节很多。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "要想三件今天很开心的事情哦……呼……呼……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "晒到了舒服的阳光、喝到了舒服的水……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "呼呼……接下来……唔……梦里……见……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "喂！睡眠大师自己睡着了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "吃到了调味均衡的烤肉……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "拿到了临时通讯器……呼……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019040",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "还有需要等我去实现的约定……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019041",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "……呼……呼……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019042",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "已经成功进入浅眠，很快会达到深眠。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42019043",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "太好了，不愧是睡眠大师呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-1069",
