      "title": "邂逅于落月·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "42021001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "等菲伊再次睁眼，她再次回到了熟悉的梦境中。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "一片空白……是我的梦境。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "text": "又见面了呀，「我」。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021005",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "只见在视野的正前方，一株盛放的鸢尾花正在轻轻摇晃。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "……原来你是这样的声音。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "鸢尾花",
          "text": "明明天天都有听到，我们的声音是一样的呀！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "我一直想要问你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "……我的存在有意义吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "作为失败品的我……可以为大家、为这个世界留下什么吗……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "鸢尾花",
          "text": "唔，明明脑海里已经存储了这么多回忆，但还是不明白吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "鸢尾花",
          "text": "你给星洛选择了合适的小蘑菇！还吃了很好吃的烤肉！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "鸢尾花",
          "text": "还有还有，救了一位大演员……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "鸢尾花",
          "text": "还和伙伴们一起冒险！太多啦，都说不完！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "可是这些只是他人的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "鸢尾花",
          "text": "你已经在这么多生命的回忆中留下了痕迹，怎么会找不到意义呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021018",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "无数情感与回忆的碎片化作浪潮冲击着菲伊本已不存在的心脏。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "鸢尾花",
          "text": "相遇本身就是意义哦！就像我和你一样！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "……我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021021",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "最终，心脏的鼓动将菲伊从梦中唤醒。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "脑电波检测结束，无异常，已唤醒。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "呼，太好了，平安无事呢，恭喜你完成任务。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "好耶！！！烤肉也已经完成啦！！！大家快来吧！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "原来大家的记忆里已经有我的存在……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021026",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "银月已经爬上了城市楼顶，菲伊第一次觉得月光竟然是如此温暖的事物。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021027",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "与此同时，月光些微照亮的暗巷中。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "……太好了呢，看样子找到答案了，菲伊小姐。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "好久不见了，贝歌女士。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "凛……好久不见，希望我们这次的谈话可以稍微平和一点。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42021031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "这就要取决于你了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
